@startuml
actor "Staff User" as User
participant "React Frontend" as UI
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB

User -> UI: Open LSF Students Tab
UI -> API: GET /api/students/
API -> DB: Query Students & Aggregates
DB --> API: Return Data
API --> UI: JSON Students List
UI --> User: Display Student Directory

User -> UI: Click on Student Card
UI -> API: GET /api/students/{id}
API -> DB: Query Joined Transcript Data
DB --> API: Return Data
API --> UI: JSON Transcript
UI --> User: Display Interactive Transcript Grid

User -> UI: Edit Grade & Click "Save"
UI -> API: POST /api/grades/
API -> DB: Update ExamResult by result_id
DB --> API: Commit Transaction
API --> UI: Success Message
UI --> User: Show Green Toast Notification
@enduml
